==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Moblin Fangs are [[Monster Part]]s that are dropped by all types of [[Moblin]]s and [[Stalmoblin]]s when they're defeated. They are sharp and too hard to be reshaped. They can be used in a [[Cooking Pot]] with critters to make [[Elixir]]s.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> The [[Kochi Dye Shop]] can also use Moblin Fangs to make [[Gray Dye]], and [[Kilton]] at the [[Fang and Bone]] accepts them in exchange for [[Mon]].

The [[Fireproof Armor]] [[Armor Set]] needs four Moblin Fangs to upgrade each of its pieces to their second tier at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].
{{Material Armors|BotW|Moblin Fang}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
Moblin Fangs are dropped by [[Moblin]]s upon their defeat.

Moblin Fangs are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|TotK|Moblin Fang}}

